  "articleBody": "Start by defining how your home should work better, then prepare property information, priorities, and budget boundaries for the consultation. During the meeting, review existing conditions, possible layouts, design development, permit responsibilities, construction coordination, selections, and next decisions. Finish by requesting a written scope that makes competing providers easier to compare.",
